    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būgabīji bo ng'wa Melikizedeki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Melikizedeki ng'wenūyū walī Ntemi wa Salemu, na Ngabīji wa ng'wa Mulungu ūyo alī higūlya no. Ū munhū ng'wenūyo, akamanhya nū Abulahamu ūmfuuha lubango. Ī likanza lyenīlo, ū Abulahamu wafumaga kwilwisha būlūgū na batemi balebe, abo akabapyena ūbabūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Abulahamu nang'hwe ūng'winha īmò ya ng'wikūmi ya shikolo shose; ū kūshomelejiwa kwa lina lyenīlo “Ī Melikizedeki,” ī soolo ya mhayo, Ntemi wa būtūngīlīja, hama hangī Ntemi wa Salemu, makūlū gaho Ntemi wa Mhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atī na ise nūūlū nina, na atafumile mu lūganda lūlebe, hama ī shikū jakwe jitī na wandījo, nū būpanga bokwe būtī na būkalīkījo. Atūūlilwe kūbiza Ngabīji wa welelo bose, gīt'ūmo alī Ng'wana wa ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū nolagi ūmo alī ū būtaale ū munhū ng'wenūyo, ūyo sīswe Abulahamu akang'winha īmò ya ng'wikūmi ya shisonzwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūmo gahayīlile a malange, a ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Lawī abo bakanukūlaga nīmo gwa būgabīji, h'abo batūūlīlilwe shilagīlo sha kūsola īmò ya ng'wikūmi kūfuma ū kū banhū. Hū kūhaya kūfuma kū badūgū babo, nguno pye bafumile mu būbyīle bo ng'wa Abulahamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Melikizedeki walī atī wa kūfuma mu lūganda lwabo, ūyo akanukūla īmò ya ng'wikūmi kūfuma ū kūlī Abulahamu; nang'hwe ūmfuuha lubango ū Abulahamu, munhū ūyo walī wamala kwinhwa mhayo gwa kwisagījiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ūyo gūmanīkile gūlī gīkī, ū ndo h'ūyo akafuuhagwa lubango na ntaale; ndūhū ī halalī ū mu mhayo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a henaha galīho mapandī abīlī, ū kwipandī ī līmò tūlībona gīkī īy'īmò ya ng'wikūmi īkanukūlagwa na banhū abo bakachaaga. Alīyo ī lipandī ī līngī, ū ng'wanukūji alīkaanīlwa gīkī atī wa kūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose hū kūhaya gīkī, nū Lawī ūyo akasolaga īmò ya ng'wikūmi, nang'hwe wamala kwīfunya kūbītīla mulī Abulahamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno walī ataalī ū mu mīlī gwa nkūlūgenji wakwe, aho akamanhya nū Melikizedeki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būgabīji būpya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū ja būgabīji bo lūganda lwa ng'wa Lawī, a banhū baalī binhwa shilagīlo sha kūbasuga. Hūna lūūlū ū būshikanu ūlū ni boolī būdūgije kwigela mu nzīla ya būgabīji wenūbo, nibūlī hangī būtūūlwe ho būgabīji būngī bo mbika ya ng'wa Melikizedeki, būleke kūhayiwa gīkī bo ng'wa Alooni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya ū būgabīji ūlū būgalūchiwa, nī shilagīlo shiigelile kūgalūchiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūyo alīhayiwa ū mu mihayo yenīyī afumile mu lūganda lūngī gete, ūmo atīmo nūūlū ūmò ūyo walī wabīta kwifunya kūbiza ntūmami wa ha ng'walīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īlī hape gīkī ū Seeba wise afumile mu lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda; alīyo hangī ū Musa h'atahayile mhayo gose gose gwa bagabīji ba mu lūganda lwenūlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū mhayo gwa kūbiza ho ngabīji ūngī wa mbika ya ng'wa Melikizedeki, gūlongeja kūyoolecha hape īyo tūlīyīhaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ū ng'wene atīho kūlwa kūshikīlīja malange ga shilagīlo sha mu mīlī, alīyo mu būdūla bo būpanga ūbo būtī bo kūkenaagūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno gūhayiwe hape gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
